# Type discipline (encode in structure)

Prefer a type, lint rule, or `bun run verify` failure over another comment or AGENTS.md note.

- Discriminated unions with a `kind` (or equivalent) literal. No optional-field bags that allow impossible combinations.
- Exhaustive `switch` over unions: `default: { const _exhaustive: never = x; return _exhaustive; }` or `assertNever`.
- External data is `unknown` until parsed (Zod at API/content boundaries). No `any`, no unchecked `as`.
- `unknown` over `any`. Cast only after a runtime check (`instanceof`, schema parse, typeof).
- Pages stay thin; interactive client state lives in islands. Do not add a new island framework without removing the other.
